    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "The GRITSS computed ranges file will be delivered to the VLBI stations daily and will contain one-way computed range observation estimates from the GRITSS VLBI transmitter phase center to the VLBI ground station receiver phase centers. These files will be used by the VLBI stations to assist in their computation of the final observed ranges. There will be one file produced per station per day, with each file containing all VLBI passes from that day. Any passes that cross over a day boundary will be included in both the current day\u2019s file and the next/previous day\u2019s file.",
